  <item>
    <title>track 14 婚姻不是抓手 婚姻是一面明镜🪞</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bbe12005a90dfd0d6b5876</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bbe12005a90dfd0d6b5876</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Feb 2025 03:27:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们回来啦！！！欢迎光临今天的：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIbTMrYzG2taDE6b1IVD_SIDXZa.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>今天我们聊聊：</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于婚姻的看法。20+的海里跟30+的summer，对于婚前婚后的看法，掉入现实的明镜，婚后面对的经济压力和家庭责任。两人还探讨了如何在亲密关系中保持理解和包容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于训练计划：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">00:02:05</a>:为什么晚点考虑结婚啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">00:04:07</a>:婚姻的感受与经历：顺其自然还是条件写好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">00:06:17</a>:从穷困到有房有车：我们的婚姻见证了生活的变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">00:09:34</a>:爱情与婚姻：看对人之前，先了解自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">00:12:44</a>:说钱真的不是伤感情！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">00:19:08</a>:婚姻与现实：年龄差异、经济压力和家务分配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">00:22:19</a>:建立共同资产是基本的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">00:25:31</a>:突破阶级？婚姻是否能带来真正的改变？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">00:28:41</a>:一地鸡毛的婚后，维护是必须的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2106">00:35:06</a>:婚姻前的重要决策：先了解自己吧！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是谁？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgjrehrqdnmf_srgrJDSTxhRixMY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoNKbVV9y74Yt98nl2yFq6U-XJB7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTZ54vQLizdWmxSd_n3z15gPeGd.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
