  <item>
    <title>track 13 一生要‘瘦’的中国女人，结论：怪晚学风潮（怕</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678d748f9420ede9d135c499</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678d748f9420ede9d135c499</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 21:59:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIbTMrYzG2taDE6b1IVD_SIDXZa.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>今日训练：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们常常以为，只有明码标价的东西才需要付出，但实际上，生活中的每一个选择都在无形中标好了价格。</span><em><strong><span>追求好身材、事业成功、幸福关系……看似光鲜的背后，都伴随着我们看不到的代价与取舍。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>我俩结合自己的亲身经历，聊聊那些隐形的“账单”：为了取悦别人而牺牲自我，为了完美身材而失去健康，为了事业拼尽全力却忽略了内心的声音。（本期花销50个w！！！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们经历了因为‘身材’而遭遇被骗钱、痛苦的感情，高考的失利，也因为这些转折点开始重新认识自己。从极端的饮食控制到身材焦虑，听到最后，也许你才能明白健康和内心的安宁远比外表的完美更重要。去接纳真实的自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>summer从58kg 到现在65kg ：身心快乐 状态稳定 &nbsp;稳定发疯🤪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FruCh4SDkjP51sdDHlMYtzCCfh5k.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>海里 从40+kg到现在的女帝，帅翻了！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhznO5vw_B-ZWeDlY8xSl-oDrOmB.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>今日训练菜单：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">00:02:04</a> 私人教练的生涯开启！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">00:04:12</a> 追溯大学时期的健身热潮与健美比赛的兴起！👙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">00:08:25</a> 哇，这就是大肌霸的世界☄️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">00:12:41</a> 身材管理秘籍？不存在，就是饿。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">00:16:56</a> 健身教练的内心矛盾：身材对于我的价值在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1271">00:21:11</a>一切的努力付之一炬的绝望。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">00:29:40</a> 花上50个w，你就看开了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">00:33:54</a> 海里遇上npd男盆友，导致高考失利！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">00:38:09</a> 真实的青春让我重新审视了自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2798">00:46:38</a> 最后责任竟然由‘晚晚’承担，很怕被网暴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于教练：小hx </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54847a31d6e4a9281a53edc1?xsec_token=YB1B8kYzE6BrvkqSNyeRkkG0UolR8hicDrC2TqwaYD4HQ=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=54847a31d6e4a9281a53edc1&amp;apptime=1735424741&amp;share_id=098e9e3021934418b29583704857ab75" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54847a31d6e4a9281a53edc1?xsec_token=YB1B8kYzE6BrvkqSNyeRkkG0UolR8hicDrC2TqwaYD4HQ=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=54847a31d6e4a9281a53edc1&amp;apptime=1735424741&amp;share_id=098e9e3021934418b29583704857ab75"><span>summer头子！</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e2112270000000001008507?xsec_token=YBmo-L9rnRQPWLgE3_Gcs1JJipuzlfgCbMK9N5S76yWQs=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=54847a31d6e4a9281a53edc1&amp;apptime=1735424796&amp;share_id=1e553408931b472282c5f856d70f1c7a" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e2112270000000001008507?xsec_token=YBmo-L9rnRQPWLgE3_Gcs1JJipuzlfgCbMK9N5S76yWQs=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=54847a31d6e4a9281a53edc1&amp;apptime=1735424796&amp;share_id=1e553408931b472282c5f856d70f1c7a"><span>海狸大王</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgjrehrqdnmf_srgrJDSTxhRixMY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoNKbVV9y74Yt98nl2yFq6U-XJB7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTZ54vQLizdWmxSd_n3z15gPeGd.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
